                    <span class="faq-chevron"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-a">No. Your DocScore never expires unless you use it. Recharge once and use it over weeks or months at your own pace — no pressure.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-q">
                    When is the score added to my account?
                    <span class="faq-chevron"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-a">Instantly — as soon as Razorpay verifies your payment, your DocScore is credited to your account automatically. You'll see it update in the topbar right away.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-q">
                    Is my payment information safe?
                    <span class="faq-chevron"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-a">Yes. All payments are processed by Razorpay, India's most trusted payment infrastructure. Your card or UPI details never touch DocUp's servers — Razorpay handles everything end-to-end with bank-grade encryption.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <button class="faq-q">
                    What payment methods are accepted?
                    <span class="faq-chevron"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
                </button>
                <div class="faq-a">All major methods are supported — UPI (PhonePe, GPay, Paytm), debit & credit cards (Visa, Mastercard, RuPay), net banking, and popular wallets.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

